    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486310/extras/d8d14fc76bf718525f79f721efde869f.avif?t=1738239925\" /></span><br><br>Meet loyal companions along your journey and raise your retinue. With 21 different classes and powerful relics to be found, you can build your soldiers into deadly weapons to turn the tides of battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486310/extras/1dce6b8ca5472730837a977770c5fdc2.poster.avif?t=1738239925\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486310/extras/1dce6b8ca5472730837a977770c5fdc2.webm?t=1738239925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486310/extras/1dce6b8ca5472730837a977770c5fdc2.mp4?t=1738239925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486310/extras/325e771e08637169c05da22e7698eb09.avif?t=1738239925\" /></span><br><br>Our goal is to recreate the feeling you get from looking at a medieval painting or manuscript, be it depicting battles against beasts, large armies colliding or sieges of a castle. A lot of the graphics style is directly inspired by medieval paintings, bringing them to life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486310/extras/e254bbebdcba0166add32456c429a4d2.avif?t=1738239925\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486310/extras/0515a318d9f3a1c5cd8f546a8ac4ca4b.avif?t=1738239925\" /></span><br><br>Start as a peasant and make your way into the top. Hel